# CSS Style Rules

All CSS follows glassmorphism design system. Reference [popup.css](mdc:popup.css) for implementation.

## Design System

### Theme Variables
- Primary background: `var(--primary-bg)`
- Text color: `var(--text-primary)`
- Accent color: `var(--accent-color)`
- Border color: `var(--border-color)`
- Shadows: `var(--shadow-sm)`, `var(--shadow-md)`, `var(--shadow-lg)`

### Dark Mode
- Controlled via `[data-theme="dark"]` attribute
- All colors switch via CSS custom properties
- Theme toggle in header

## Layout Rules

### Container
- Popup size: 400x600px default
- Padding bottom: 60px (for floating nav)
- Flex column layout

### Views
- All views hidden by default: `.hidden` class
- View switching: Remove/add `.hidden` class
- No fixed heights: Content determines height

### Components
- Glassmorphism: `backdrop-filter: blur(10px)`
- Cards: White background with subtle shadow
- Buttons: Clear visual hierarchy
- Modals: Overlay with backdrop blur

## Typography

### Font Stack
```css
font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
```

### Hierarchy
- Headings: Bold, clear size differentiation
- Body: 14px base, 1.75 line-height
- Small text: 12px for secondary information

## Accessibility

### Focus States
- All interactive elements have visible focus indicators
- Keyboard navigation supported
- ARIA labels on semantic elements

### Color Contrast
- Text meets WCAG AA standards
- Dark mode maintains contrast ratios
- No color-only information conveyance

## Performance

### Animations
- Use CSS transforms (GPU accelerated)
- 60fps target for all animations
- Prefers-reduced-motion support

### Selectors
- Efficient selectors (avoid deep nesting)
- Class-based styling (not ID-based)
- Minimal specificity conflicts

## Prohibited Patterns

- No inline styles (except dynamic theme)
- No !important (unless absolutely necessary)
- No external fonts (system fonts only)
- No fixed pixel widths (use relative units)
